---
type: pr
id: PR-0209
title: "Flunk-Out Frenzy: end-to-end launch-to-drop telemetry contract and deterministic trace matrix"
status: ready
owners: "agents"
created: 2026-04-03
updated: 2026-04-03
stories:
  - "ST-25-06"
tags: ["frontend", "games", "launcher", "telemetry", "observability", "proof-first", "deterministic", "no-shortcuts"]
dependencies:
